On the gauge- and $G$-invariant Hilbert space, there are $\delta>0$ and $h_1<\infty$ such that, for all $h\ge h_1$, $$\label{count:odd-gap}
 \left\lVert D_u(h,1)\psi\right\rVert\ge\delta\left\lVert \psi\right\rVert
